 h Ave\, St Pete Beach\, FL 33706). 10AM to 3PM ET. Brothers\, friends and f
 amily are welcome and encouraged to attend! Bring your own drinks and snack
 s. Suggested to bring your own sun screen\, towels\, umbrella or any other 
 beach grear. Your Worshipful Master and first Lady will be providing some d
 rinks and snacks\, including Pub Subs! Some of us will be bringing our meta
 l detectors for some treasures hunting fun! I look forward to seeing all my
  Brothers\, their friends\, family\, and children at this event if it is wi
 thin your cable tow. We plan to have a wonderful and fun day in the Sun :su
